      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I suggest you rename this to \"Steam Login to Multiple VRChat Accounts\" - but I love this idea! I use different names for different friend-circles, and I hate having to cancel the Steam auto-login process and then one-finger-type in the other account password on the in-game virtual keyboard.\nInstead of doing that or using multiple Steam accounts, I wish I could just login to Steam, put my headset on, boot VRChat, tap on the identity/name I feel like using, boom, done.\nThis feature effectively makes the Steam account useful again - turning it into a multi-VRC-account identity manager system.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-02-16T10:47:09.176Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be nice if it would be possible to link more than 1 accounts to your Steam Account rather than limiting it to only 1. What I mean by this is that it would be nice to be able to override a already linked vrchat account which is linked to a Steam account example: Linking the wrong vrchat account to your Steam and vise versa.",
